        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Image Composition with Depth Registration - ISCAS 2023</title>\n<style>\n  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"SimSun\", sans-serif;\n    background: #fff;\n    color: #333;\n    max-width: 1100px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 0;\n  }\n  .header {\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e87722, #f5a623, #e87722);\n    padding: 15px 30px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    color: white;\n  }\n  .header-left {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 15px;\n  }\n  .header-logo {\n    font-size: 36px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-style: italic;\n    color: white;\n    text-shadow: 1px 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\n  }\n  .header-text {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n  }\n  .header-year {\n    font-size: 42px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #fff;\n    margin-left: 10px;\n  }\n  .header-right {\n    font-size: 28px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #4a2080;\n  }\n  .header-sub {\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f5a623, #e87722);\n    height: 8px;\n  }\n  .title-block {\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 30px 20px 20px;\n  }\n  .title-en {\n    font-size: 28px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #000;\n    margin-bottom: 5px;\n  }\n  .title-cn {\n    font-size: 26px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #000;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  .authors {\n    font-size: 22px;\n    color: #000;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  .conference {\n    font-size: 16px;\n    color: #000;\n    margin-bottom: 5px;\n  }\n  .contact {\n    font-size: 16px;\n    color: #000;\n  }\n  .main-content {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 20px;\n    padding: 10px 20px 20px;\n  }\n  .left-col {\n    flex: 1;\n    min-width: 0;\n  }\n  .right-col {\n    flex: 1;\n    min-width: 0;\n  }\n  .section-title {\n    font-size: 20px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #cc0000;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n    margin-top: 15px;\n  }\n  .section-title:first-child {\n    margin-top: 0;\n  }\n  .section-text {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.8;\n    text-indent: 2em;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n  }\n  .method-list {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.8;\n    margin-left: 0;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  .method-list p {\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n  }\n  .placeholder-img {\n    background: #f0f0f0;\n    border: 1px solid #ddd;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    color: #999;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    margin: 10px auto;\n  }\n  .img-row {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 10px;\n    justify-content: center;\n    margin: 10px 0;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n  }\n  .img-item {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 11px;\n  }\n  .img-item .placeholder-img {\n    margin: 0 auto 4px;\n  }\n  .depth-reg-list {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.8;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  .depth-reg-list p {\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n  }\n  .seg-list {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.8;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  .seg-list p {\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n  }\n  .chart-placeholder {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 200px;\n    background: #f9f9f9;\n    border: 1px solid #ddd;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    margin: 10px 0;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    color: #999;\n  }\n  .comparison-text {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.8;\n    text-indent: 2em;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  .table-container {\n    margin: 10px 0;\n    overflow-x: auto;\n  }\n  table {\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    width: 100%;\n  }\n  table th, table td {\n    border: 1px solid #ccc;\n    padding: 3px 6px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  table th {\n    background: #f5f5f5;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .conclusion-text {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.8;\n    text-indent: 2em;\n  }\n  .footer {\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e87722, #f5a623, #e87722);\n    height: 60px;\n    margin-top: 20px;\n  }\n  .flowchart-placeholder {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 120px;\n    background: #f9f9f9;\n    border: 1px solid #ddd;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    margin: 10px 0;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    color: #999;\n  }\n  .depth-img-row {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 10px;\n    justify-content: center;\n    margin: 10px 0;\n  }\n  .depth-img-item {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    flex: 1;\n  }\n  .depth-img-item .placeholder-img {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100px;\n    margin: 0 auto 4px;\n  }\n  .grid-images {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr);\n    gap: 4px;\n    margin: 10px 0;\n  }\n  .grid-images .placeholder-img {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 60px;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .grid-labels {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-around;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  .time-table {\n    margin: 10px auto;\n    width: 80%;\n  }\n  .time-table table {\n    font-size: 11px;\n  }\n  .time-table th, .time-table td {\n    padding: 2px 8px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"header\">\n  <div class=\"header-left\">\n    <div class=\"header-logo\">ISCAS</div>\n    <div class=\"header-text\">\n      中国科学院软件研究所学术年会 <span class=\"header-year\">2023</span><br>\n      暨计算机科学国家重点实验室开放周\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"header-right\">学术论文</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"header-sub\"></div>\n\n<div class=\"title-block\">\n  <div class=\"title-en\">Image Composition with Depth Registration</div>\n  <div class=\"title-cn\">基于深度注册的嵌入式图像合成</div>\n  <div class=\"authors\">李赞、王文成、侯飞</div>\n  <div class=\"conference\">International Joint Conference on Artificial Intelligence(IJCAI-2023)</div>\n  <div class=\"contact\">联系人：李赞，18810762067，lizhan@ios.ac.cn</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"main-content\">\n  <div class=\"left-col\">\n    <div class=\"section-title\">背景</div>\n    <p class=\"section-text\">图像合成是指将不同图像中的内容融合成一张看似真实的图像。已有的图像合成方法主要探讨色彩、阴影和亮度的和谐生成，对于图像内容之间的遮挡关系研究不多，往往需要费时的手动处理而效率不高。</p>\n\n    <div class=\"section-title\">方法</div>\n    <p class=\"section-text\">本文提出新的方法，从源图像中选择要融入目标图像中的内容（称为源内容）后，通过深度注册，将源内容融入目标图像所表达的三维空间中，由此，用户进行源内容在目标图像中不同位置的摆放时，融合处理可基于图像内容的深度方便判断它们之间的遮挡关系，以得到遮挡关系合理处理的合成图像。其处理步骤如下：</p>\n    <div class=\"method-list\">\n      <p>(a)基于深度学习方法进行源图像和目标图像的深度估计；</p>\n      <p>(b)基于深度注册初始化，将源内容融入目标图像所表达的三维空间；</p>\n      <p>(c)迭代进行图像分割/深度的调整，以优化深度注册，直至获得满意的合成结果。</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"flowchart-placeholder\">[Flowchart: Source image → (a) Source image patch → (b) difference-template → (c) use template → (d) target-source image patch → (e) refinement → depth/segmentation → satisfied? → Output]</div>\n\n    <div class=\"section-title\" style=\"font-size:16px;\">深度注册：</div>\n    <div class=\"depth-reg-list\">\n      <p>(a)将源内容放至目标图像中，并调整其大小使得其与目标图像中的一个内容具有相似深度；</p>\n      <p>(b)将目标图像中该内容的锚点像素的深度值赋予源内容的锚点像素(一般来说选择图像内容所有像素中y值最小的点作为锚点)；</p>\n      <p>(c)根据相机成像原理，建立源内容深度和大小之间的关系；</p>\n      <p>(d)用户根据编辑意向设定源内容的位置、大小后，根据上述关系计算源内容各像素的深度，完成深度注册。</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"depth-img-row\">\n      <div class=\"depth-img-item\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"height:100px;\">[Image: cow in field]</div>\n        <div>(a)输入</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"depth-img-item\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"height:100px;\">[Image: depth map]</div>\n        <div>(b)深度注册</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"depth-img-item\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"height:100px;\">[Image: anchor points]</div>\n        <div>(c)锚点</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"section-title\" style=\"font-size:16px;\">分割 / 深度的优化调整：</div>\n    <div class=\"seg-list\">\n      <p>(a)分割优化：根据合成图像需求，进行更细致合理的分割，如分割开椅子座上的鸭子等。</p>\n      <p>(b)深度优化：根据编辑操作建立约束条件，更新源内容的深度值，以更适合图像合成处理。</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"section-title\">实验结果</div>\n    <p class=\"section-text\">本方法可逐步优化深度注册，使源内容更合理融入目标图像对应的三维空间，方便图像合成的遮挡关系处理。如下图所示，在用户频繁改变源图像内容的位置时，只有第一次嵌入需要进行分割优化处理，故交互次数稍高。随后，再次改变源图像内容的位置，则无需更多的调整；反观常用的Photoshop方法，其每次合成处理都需要较多的用户交互。</p>\n\n    <div class=\"chart-placeholder\">\n      [Chart: Line chart showing interactions vs composition orders. Blue line (PhotoShop): 54, 67, 59, 62. Orange line (Our method): 7, 3, 2, 2. X-axis: composition orders 1-4. Y-axis: interactions 0-80.]\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"right-col\">\n    <div class=\"img-row\" style=\"flex-wrap:wrap;\">\n      <div class=\"img-item\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"width:160px;height:100px;\">[Image: cyclists on track]</div>\n        <div>(a)目标图像</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"img-item\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"width:100px;height:100px;\">[Image: single cyclist]</div>\n        <div>(b)源图像</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"img-row\" style=\"flex-wrap:wrap;\">\n      <div class=\"img-item\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"width:160px;height:100px;\">[Image: first composition]</div>\n        <div>(c)第一次合成</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"img-item\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"width:160px;height:100px;\">[Image: second composition]</div>\n        <div>(d)第二次合成</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"img-row\" style=\"flex-wrap:wrap;\">\n      <div class=\"img-item\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"width:160px;height:100px;\">[Image: third composition]</div>\n        <div>(e)第三次合成</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"img-item\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"width:160px;height:100px;\">[Image: fourth composition]</div>\n        <div>(f)第四次合成</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"comparison-text\">本方法所得到合成结果，与基于深度学习的CompGAN方法、传统Tan的方法相比，能合理处理遮挡关系；与PhotoShop方法相比，合成结果相当，但我们所需时间开销和交互次数大幅减少。</p>\n\n    <div class=\"grid-images\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"height:60px;\">[Source: bird]</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"height:60px;\">[Target: room]</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"height:60px;\">[compGAN]</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"height:60px;\">[Tan]</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"height:60px;\">[PS]</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"height:60px;\">[Ours]</div>\n\n      <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"height:60px;\">[Source: balloons]</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"height:60px;\">[Target: room]</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"height:60px;\">[compGAN]</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"height:60px;\">[Tan]</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"height:60px;\">[PS]</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"height:60px;\">[Ours]</div>\n\n      <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"height:60px;\">[Source: person]</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"height:60px;\">[Target: field]</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"height:60px;\">[compGAN]</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"height:60px;\">[Tan]</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"height:60px;\">[PS]</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"height:60px;\">[Ours]</div>\n\n      <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"height:60px;\">[Source: flowers]</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"height:60px;\">[Target: room]</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"height:60px;\">[compGAN]</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"height:60px;\">[Tan]</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"height:60px;\">[PS]</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"height:60px;\">[Ours]</div>\n\n      <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"height:60px;\">[Source: towels]</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"height:60px;\">[Target: bedroom]</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"height:60px;\">[compGAN]</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"height:60px;\">[Tan]</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"height:60px;\">[PS]</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"height:60px;\">[Ours]</div>\n\n      <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"height:60px;\">[Source: ball]</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"height:60px;\">[Target: room]</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"height:60px;\">[compGAN]</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"height:60px;\">[Tan]</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"height:60px;\">[PS]</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"height:60px;\">[Ours]</div>\n\n      <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"height:60px;\">[Source: teddy]</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"height:60px;\">[Target: room]</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"height:60px;\">[compGAN]</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"height:60px;\">[Tan]</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"height:60px;\">[PS]</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"height:60px;\">[Ours]</div>\n\n      <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"height:60px;\">[Source: plunger]</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"height:60px;\">[Target: bathroom]</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"height:60px;\">[compGAN]</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"height:60px;\">[Tan]</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"height:60px;\">[PS]</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"height:60px;\">[Ours]</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid-labels\">\n      <span>(a)源图像</span>\n      <span>(b)目标图像</span>\n      <span>(c)compGAN</span>\n      <span>(d)Tan的方法</span>\n      <span>(e)PS</span>\n      <span>(f)我们的方法</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"comparison-text\">对于上图的八个例子，我们用准确率和F1分数来度量源内容在合成图像中具有正确遮挡标签的像素占比，结果如下表所示：</p>\n\n    <div class=\"table-container\">\n      <table>\n        <tr>\n          <th rowspan=\"2\"></th>\n          <th colspan=\"5\">Accuracy</th>\n          <th colspan=\"5\">F1 score</th>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <th>CompGAN</th>\n          <th>Tan's</th>\n          <th>PS</th>\n          <th>Ours</th>\n          <th>Ours*</th>\n          <th>CompGAN</th>\n          <th>Tan's</th>\n          <th>PS</th>\n          <th>Ours</th>\n          <th>Ours*</th>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>Row1</td><td>0.2100</td><td>0.7001</td><td>1.0000</td><td>0.9826</td><td>-</td><td>0.3472</td><td>0.8236</td><td>1.0000</td><td>0.9912</td><td>-</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>Row2</td><td>0.0000</td><td>0.7951</td><td>1.0000</td><td>0.9896</td><td>-</td><td>0.0000</td><td>0.8858</td><td>1.0000</td><td>0.9948</td><td>-</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>Row3</td><td>0.1674</td><td>0.8163</td><td>1.0000</td><td>0.9799</td><td>-</td><td>0.2694</td><td>0.8989</td><td>1.0000</td><td>0.9875</td><td>-</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>Row4</td><td>0.4322</td><td>0.6304</td><td>1.0000</td><td>0.7846</td><td>0.9995</td><td>0.5186</td><td>0.7733</td><td>1.0000</td><td>0.8326</td><td>0.9996</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>Row5</td><td>0.4503</td><td>0.7913</td><td>1.0000</td><td>0.9687</td><td>-</td><td>0.5910</td><td>0.8835</td><td>1.0000</td><td>0.9798</td><td>-</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>Row6</td><td>0.5222</td><td>0.5786</td><td>1.0000</td><td>0.9731</td><td>-</td><td>0.6557</td><td>0.7331</td><td>1.0000</td><td>0.9762</td><td>-</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>Row7</td><td>0.0000</td><td>0.9178</td><td>1.0000</td><td>0.9218</td><td>0.9887</td><td>0.0000</td><td>0.9572</td><td>1.0000</td><td>0.9586</td><td>0.9938</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>Row8</td><td>0.1998</td><td>0.8357</td><td>1.0000</td><td>0.9809</td><td>-</td><td>0.3363</td><td>0.9105</td><td>1.0000</td><td>0.9884</td><td>-</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>Average</td><td>0.2477</td><td>0.7582</td><td>1.0000</td><td>0.9477</td><td>0.9941</td><td>0.3398</td><td>0.8582</td><td>1.0000</td><td>0.9637</td><td>0.9967</td>\n        </tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"comparison-text\">可以看到我们的方法在各项指标中都是最好的。上表中，Ours*表示使用优化调整的结果，可知我们只有极少数需要用到优化调整，大多数情况下可以直接得到和PhotoShop相媲美的结果。如下表所示，本方法平均比Photoshop方法快4倍多，所需交互次数也少很多。</p>\n\n    <div class=\"time-table\">\n      <table>\n        <tr>\n          <th rowspan=\"2\"></th>\n          <th colspan=\"2\">Photoshop</th>\n          <th colspan=\"2\">Ours</th>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <th>Time</th>\n          <th>Interventions</th>\n          <th>Time</th>\n          <th>Interventions</th>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>Row1</td><td>142.0s</td><td>71</td><td>33.0s</td><td>4</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>Row2</td><td>158.0s</td><td>84</td><td>34.0s</td><td>5</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>Row3</td><td>139.0s</td><td>87</td><td>32.0s</td><td>4</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>Row4</td><td>160.0s</td><td>93</td><td>44.0s</td><td>5</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>Row5</td><td>144.0s</td><td>77</td><td>45.0s</td><td>5</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>Row6</td><td>137.0s</td><td>75</td><td>33.0s</td><td>4</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>Row7</td><td>133.0s</td><td>82</td><td>35.0s</td><td>4</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>Row8</td><td>152.0s</td><td>73</td><td>34.0s</td><td>4</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>Average</td><td>145.6s</td><td>80.3</td><td>36.3s</td><td>4.4</td>\n        </tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"section-title\">结论</div>\n    <p class=\"conclusion-text\">本文提出的深度注册方法，促进了嵌入式图像合成的方便高效实现，降低了图像内容创作门槛，将提高电影、动画和艺术创作等领域的工作成效。</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"footer\"></div>\n\n</body>\n</html>",
